{
  "document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "seg-0",
      "type": "Memory",
      "subtype": "PastExperience",
      "text_span": "I was in my first year of my diploma, and everything was new since I had spent my first year online.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 100
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-1",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "Notification",
      "text_span": "One day, I was going through my college group, and a notification popped up for an internship.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 101,
        "end": 195
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 1,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-2",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "Description",
      "text_span": "The pitch was almost funny.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 196,
        "end": 223
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-3",
      "type": "Claim",
      "subtype": "Definition",
      "text_span": "It was essentially a setup to sell courses to get incentives, get promoted to team leader, and then make more money based on the team's performance.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 224,
        "end": 372
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 0.5,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-4",
      "type": "Claim",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "In short, a salesman.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 373,
        "end": 394
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 0.5,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-5",
      "type": "Decision",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "I thought, why not try it?",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 395,
        "end": 421
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-6",
      "type": "Decision",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "So, I joined.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 422,
        "end": 435
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-7",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "Assignment",
      "text_span": "I joined under a team leader.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 436,
        "end": 465
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 1,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-8",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "I think her name was Shruti.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 466,
        "end": 494
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-9",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "I was under her for a month and didn't make any sales, which was obvious.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 495,
        "end": 568
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-10",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "Eventually, I got transferred to a different team.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 569,
        "end": 619
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 1,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-11",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "This time I had two team leaders, a girl and a guy who turned out to be a couple.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 620,
        "end": 701
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 1,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-12",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "Their names were Vanshika and Shivam.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 702,
        "end": 739
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-13",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "They were pretty cool, and since everything was new to me, I was fascinated by the environment.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 740,
        "end": 835
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-14",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "Then, I got introduced to a new girl named Mink.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 836,
        "end": 884
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 1,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-15",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "She was also a team lead.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 885,
        "end": 910
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 1,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-16",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "We were in an informal meeting together, and I found out she was studying finance and law.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 911,
        "end": 1001
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-17",
      "type": "Claim",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "During that meet, I cracked a joke, saying that since she was a lawyer, I would prefer to stay shut because she could put me in jail.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1002,
        "end": 1135
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "citation",
        "ref": "Mink"
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 0.2,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-18",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "After that, we didn't speak.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1136,
        "end": 1164
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 1,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-19",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "A few days later, I was transferred to work under her team.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1165,
        "end": 1224
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 1,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-20",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "I had to text her for work, and it turned out I was blocked.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1225,
        "end": 1285
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-21",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "We eventually started talking about work and other things.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1286,
        "end": 1344
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-22",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "Some days later, I was feeling tense about my family situation, and she asked me what was up.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1345,
        "end": 1438
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-23",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "I told her, and she related to it, saying she had a similarly tough situation at home.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1439,
        "end": 1525
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-24",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "That was the turning point where we actually connected.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1526,
        "end": 1581
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 0.8,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-25",
      "type": "Decision",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "I decided to leave the internship.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1582,
        "end": 1616
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-26",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "After almost 5 to 6 months of working and making zero sales, I walked away.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1617,
        "end": 1692
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 0.8,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-27",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "By that point, Mink and I were close.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1693,
        "end": 1730
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-28",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "We talked about everything.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1731,
        "end": 1758
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-29",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "She mentioned that she had also left the internship, but she had earned the company almost 1M in total revenue, which blew my mind.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1759,
        "end": 1890
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-30",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "We were both out of the internship and growing emotionally attached.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1891,
        "end": 1959
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-31",
      "type": "Claim",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "It is probably more accurate to say it was an emotionally dependent bond.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 1960,
        "end": 2033
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 0.8,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-32",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "We both realized it was turning into something more.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 2034,
        "end": 2086
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 0.8,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-33",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "The relationship officially started in December 2021.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 2087,
        "end": 2140
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 0.8,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-34",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "She was originally from Jharkhand but was studying in Kolkata.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 2141,
        "end": 2203
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-35",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "After a few months, she decided she wanted to come to Nagpur to meet me.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 2204,
        "end": 2276
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 0.8,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-36",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "I was excited and nervous that someone was coming all the way from Kolkata just for me.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 2277,
        "end": 2364
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-37",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "We planned everything out, and she booked her tickets for April 1, 2022.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 2365,
        "end": 2437
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 0.8,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-38",
      "type": "Claim",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "Her flight was arriving at 10:45 PM, so I had to figure out a way to tell my parents I would be out.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 2438,
        "end": 2538
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 0.8,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-39",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "When her flight landed, I picked her up, and we decided to stay at the airport for a while before going to the hotel.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 2539,
        "end": 2656
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 0.8,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-40",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "The situation was tricky.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 2657,
        "end": 2682
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-41",
      "type": "Claim",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "I was 17, so legally I couldn't book tickets or a room in my name.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 2683,
        "end": 2749
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": 0.5,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-42",
      "type": "Decision",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "I asked a friend to book a room in the same hotel.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 2750,
        "end": 2800
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-43",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "Mink and I stayed at the airport until 3:45 AM, then booked a taxi to the hotel and spent the rest of the night there.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 2801,
        "end": 2919
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-44",
      "type": "Decision",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "Later, we decided to go watch a movie.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 2920,
        "end": 2958
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-45",
      "type": "Observation",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "It was RRR, and we didn't watch a single minute of it because we were so exhausted from staying up all night.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 2959,
        "end": 3068
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-46",
      "type": "Decision",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "After the movie, my friend Sujit joined us, and we went bowling.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 3069,
        "end": 3133
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-47",
      "type": "Decision",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "We bought bread and jam and decided to just stay in the metro station on the way to the airport.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 3134,
        "end": 3230
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
        "ref": null
      },
      "temporal_position": null,
      "epistemic_confidence": null,
      "synthetic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-48",
      "type": "Event",
      "subtype": "",
      "text_span": "Around 5:30 AM, we left for the airport.",
      "source_document_id": "smoke-test-doc",
      "span_location": {
        "start": 3231,
        "end": 3271
      },
      "attribution": {
        "type": "self",
